-- Lesson 8. Lists.

please remember shopping is an empty list
please add "bread" to shopping
please add "apples" to shopping
please add "tea" to shopping

please show "There are {the number of items in shopping} things to buy."

please for every thing in shopping:
    show "  - {thing}"
thanks

-- Positions count from 1, the way people count.
please show item 1 of shopping or "nothing"

please show the first item of shopping or "nothing"
please show the last item of shopping or "nothing"
please show the join of the sorted version of shopping with ", "
please show the join of the reverse of shopping with ", "
please show shopping contains "tea"

please remember numbers is an empty list
please repeat for every n from 1 to 5:
    add n to numbers
thanks
please show the total of numbers
please show the average of numbers or 0
please show the join of the rest of numbers with ", "
